OL,3,GNEWSAGraduate's sensory alarm for deaf
OL,4,Apeople wins award
OL,5,
OL,6,FA graduate who developed a sensory
OL,7,Falarm for people who are deaf and
OL,8,Fhard-of-hearing has won this year's UK
OL,9,FJames Dyson Award.
OL,11,FInspired by her own experiences in
OL,12,Fhotels, Gargi Agrawalla, who was born
OL,13,Fprofoundly deaf, invented SIVO.GO for
OL,14,Fher final-year project at Loughborough
OL,15,FUniversity.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
