OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAGraduate's sensory alarm for deaf
OL,4,Apeople wins award
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt uses artificial intelligence to
OL,7,Frecognise fire alarms and doorbells,
OL,8,Fwithout Wi-Fi or cloud processing, and
OL,9,Fcan also detect knocks and door
OL,10,Fmovement. Alerts are communicated
OL,11,Fthrough colour-coded lights, screen
OL,12,Fsymbols and haptic vibrations.
OL,14,FRumyana Dancheva, lead design engineer
OL,15,Fat Dyson, said the device was a
OL,16,F"brilliant example of a simple solution
OL,17,Fto a complex problem".
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
